---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Videos Explicativos - AutoTest" description="Videos educativos para preparar tu examen de conducir">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="text-center py-16 mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Videos Explicativos
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Refuerza tu aprendizaje con nuestros videos educativos sobre normativa vial, señales de tráfico y técnicas de conducción.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Videos Grid -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Video Placeholder 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 to-cyan-100 dark:from-blue-900/30 dark:to-cyan-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-blue-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Señales de Tráfico Básicas</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Aprende las señales más importantes para tu examen teórico.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Placeholder 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-green-100 to-emerald-100 dark:from-green-900/30 dark:to-emerald-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-green-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Normas de Circulación</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Domina las reglas fundamentales de circulación vial.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Placeholder 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-100 to-pink-100 dark:from-purple-900/30 dark:to-pink-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-purple-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.746 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.246 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Seguridad Vial</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Conceptos clave sobre conducción segura y defensiva.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Placeholder 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-red-100 dark:from-orange-900/30 dark:to-red-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Mecánica Básica</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Conocimientos básicos sobre el funcionamiento del vehículo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Placeholder 5 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-cyan-100 dark:from-teal-900/30 dark:to-cyan-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-teal-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Situaciones Especiales</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Cómo actuar en situaciones complejas de tráfico.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Placeholder 6 -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700/50 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-purple-100 dark:from-indigo-900/30 dark:to-purple-900/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 text-indigo-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Video próximamente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Consejos de Examen</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Tips y estrategias para aprobar tu examen teórico.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Instructions Section -->
    <section class="text-center">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">📹 Contenido en Desarrollo</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Estamos preparando contenido audiovisual de alta calidad para complementar tu preparación. 
          Pronto podrás acceder a videos explicativos detallados sobre todos los aspectos del examen teórico.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-200">
          <strong>Nota:</strong> Los iframes de YouTube se añadirán próximamente en esta sección.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>